<title>UK: UK final January M4 grows 9.8 percent.</title>
<headline>UK final January M4 grows 9.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England released the following data on M4 money supply (percentage changes):</p>
<p>					  M4</p>
<p>    January s/adjusted		  1.6</p>
<p>    January 12 months s/a	     9.8</p>
<p>    January unadjusted		  0.6</p>
<p>    January 12 months unadj	   9.9</p>
<p>--  London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
</text>
